From 55c6b1b7e25338a811d8db3c07087ccf91f1b048 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 04 Mar 2021 20:44:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-31170] greco_arc_gnu: add greco_arc_gnu support

Since goya2_arc_gnu is renamed to greco_arc_gnu, this patch add changes
to rename folders, files, function names from goya2 to greco. The
removal of greco folder and files will be added in subsequent patch.

Change-Id: I6355ff466401f9636e9d9fdae5e85679951b9cfb
---

diff --git a/greco_arc_gnu/Makefile b/greco_arc_gnu/Makefile
